{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36308","headline":"献浙东王大夫二首 一 · 方干","name":"献浙东王大夫二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出镇当时移越俗，致君何日不尧年。\n到来唯饮长溪水，归去应将一个钱。\n吟处美人擎笔砚，行时飞鸟避旌旃。\n四方皆是分忧寄，独有东南戴二天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36308.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36308","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}